{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","终焉圆舞"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","奥利安在指定位置召唤魔法细剑，造成多段伤害并击晕敌人。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","奥利安在指定位置召唤魔法细剑，在1.5秒内快速斩击周围1格的所有敌人，造成8段60% + 10% ATK伤害，随后细剑会引发魔力爆炸，造成420% + 40% ATK伤害并击晕范围内所有敌人3 + 0.3秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":42,"end":48,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":73,"end":79,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":96,"end":102,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":39,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":69,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","细剑斩击伤害提升至70% + 10% ATK，最终魔力爆炸的伤害提升至460% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":39,"end":45,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","细剑斩击伤害提升至80% + 10% ATK，最终魔力爆炸的伤害提升至500% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":39,"end":45,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","细剑斩击伤害提升至90% + 10% ATK，最终魔力爆炸的伤害提升至540% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":39,"end":45,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","细剑斩击伤害提升至100% + 10% ATK，最终魔力爆炸的伤害提升至600% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":40,"end":46,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":36,"end":50,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","优雅连击"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，奥利安会对自己的佩剑进行附魔。主动使用时，对目标造成多次伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，奥利安会对自己的佩剑附魔，持续15 + 2秒。“附魔”状态下，奥利安的能量获取速度提升25%，并且使用技能或普攻造成的伤害会对敌人造成一个可叠加的“灼伤”效果，持续3秒，灼伤每秒造成的伤害相当于本次原始伤害量的20% + 2%。主动使用时，奥利安向目标连续刺击4次，每次造成90% + 10% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":114,"end":119,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":146,"end":152,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":143,"end":156,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","连续刺击伤害提升至100% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","连续刺击伤害提升至110% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","连续刺击伤害提升至120% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","恩威并施"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","奥利安在战斗中招纳“党羽”强化自身力量。主动使用时，施展剑气对前方扇形区域内敌人造成伤害并获得护盾。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，每当自身首次受到非永久属性提升效果时，会使“细剑附魔”的效果延长10秒，并将该友军视为“党羽”。主动使用时，奥利安向身前1格的扇形区域斩出魔力剑气，造成340% + 40% ATK伤害，自身获得相当于本次造成伤害量200%的护盾，持续6秒，并给所有“党羽”60%的该效果。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":84,"end":90,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":80,"end":94,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","魔力剑气造成伤害提升至400% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","魔力剑气造成伤害提升至360% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","魔力剑气造成伤害提升至380% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","魔力剑气造成伤害提升至400% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中提升自身攻击力，“党羽”在场时提升更多攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，奥利安提升9%攻击力，当有“党羽”在场时额外提升6%攻击力"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，奥利安提升12%攻击力，当有“党羽”在场时额外提升8%攻击力"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，奥利安提升15%攻击力，当有“党羽”在场时额外提升10%攻击力"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","趋炎附势"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","“党羽”将为奥利安带来“势力”，每层势力使奥利安获得伤害加成和伤害减免。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","奥利安每招纳一名“党羽”都会为自身积攒1层“势力”，最多3层。每层“势力”使奥利安造成的伤害增加14%，受到的伤害降低18%，并使“灼伤”效果的时间延长1秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每层“势力”为奥利安提供的伤害加成增加至16%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","3层“势力”时，奥利安解放所有的力量，“细剑附魔”将会立即激活并永久持续。本场战斗的剩余时间内，若敌人连续处于“灼伤”状态下3秒，则会被沉默并降低60点受愈，直至“灼伤”效果结束。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":68,"end":70,"tooltip_key":"keyword:silence"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每层“势力”为奥利安提供的伤害加成增加至18%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","积累一定“势力”可使奥利安处于霸体状态，并且奥利安施加的“灼伤”效果附带真实伤害。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","奥利安累计获得3层“势力”后，本场战斗剩余时间内处于霸体状态，并且“灼伤”额外造成50%的真实伤害."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","逆羽刺剑"]]}